      "note": "Échezeaux lies in Flagey-Échezeaux and is a different Grand Cru from Grands-Échezeaux. Its official boundary overlaps a few neighbouring Premier Crus slightly; the map colours that shared ground as Grand Cru."
    },
    "inao-denom-645": {
      "note": "Grands-Échezeaux lies in Flagey-Échezeaux. It is a separate Grand Cru from Échezeaux."
    },
    "inao-denom-1271": {
      "note": "Les Beaux Monts spans Vosne-Romanée and Flagey-Échezeaux. A small corner of its official boundary overlaps Échezeaux, so this highlight includes ground the map otherwise colours as Grand Cru."
    }
